Create unit tests for wavetable synth engine.

Verify wavetable scanning, interpolation, and position modulation.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test wavetable bank loading (all 4 bundled banks)
- [ ] Test position scanning produces different timbres at different positions
- [ ] Test interpolation between adjacent frames is smooth
- [ ] Test position modulation via envelope changes timbre over note duration
- [ ] Test position modulation via LFO produces cyclic timbre change
- [ ] Test wavetable presets produce non-zero audio

## Test Plan
- [ ] Build and run wavetable_test target
- [ ] Render notes at position 0.0, 0.5, 1.0 and verify different spectra
- [ ] Render note with position envelope, verify timbre evolves
- [ ] Load each bundled bank, render a note, verify output
